From: Lei Wei <quic_leiwei@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: describe RDP433 ports and MAC storage

There are 6 PPE MAC ports available on RDP433. The port1-port4 are
connected with QCA8075 QUAD PHYs through UNIPHY0 PCS channel0-channel3. The
port5 is connected with Aquantia PHY through UNIPHY1 PCS channel0 and the
port6 is connected with Aquantia PHY through UNIPHY2 PCS channel0.

Add Aquantia NVMEM node for IPQ9574 RDP433 board to load the firmware for
the Aquantia PHY.

Add label to EDMA port for IPQ9574 RDP433 board.

Merged from:
  0349-arm64-dts-qcom-Add-IPQ9574-RDP433-port-node.patch
  0350-arm64-dts-qcom-add-AQR-NVMEM-node-for-IPQ9574-RDP433.patch
  0351-arm64-dts-qcom-Add-label-to-EDMA-port-for-IPQ9574-RD.patch

Based on work by:
  Alexandru Gagniuc <mr.nuke.me@gmail.com>
  Christian Marangi <ansuelsmth@gmail.com>
  Lei Wei <quic_leiwei@quicinc.com>

Original-commit: c5a3d88f12a7ac9546f5ead061212f06ebaab740
Original-commit: b6155e23c6c350b528a0d64dc667fefb0a5acbf6
Original-commit: 88480bcfb5a5444602b5b7019a2005a9b010cb34

Signed-off-by: Lei Wei <quic_leiwei@quicinc.com>
Signed-off-by: Alexandru Gagniuc <mr.nuke.me@gmail.com>
